; A SubViewport whose 2D content has edges on pixel centres in y. A 2D pass draws its canvas
; through a y-down frame, as the root canvas does (ADR-0057), so the rasteriser's tie rule covers
; the rows Godot covers: the polygon draws rows 300 to 359 and the line row 300 (#852). The
; container's origin is whole, so each viewport row is one screen row.

